 the D1 homes of 56 at 10 keep what they have, and what does not fit is dropped, not given to another cell; the raised homes of 168 grow to 170 into their new D3 room; the offices' jobs reach 86. Each station then builds the empty cell beside people nearest it, homes of 4 with their D1 building: Alpha row 1 column 2 (11), Beta 1, 3 (12), Gamma 1, 4 (13). The land and buildings after the night are worked out from the rules and the measured service by an independent Python implementation (tools/golden-checks/city_growth.py); the railway, passenger and account values are GameCore's, as in economy.json.",
